---
// The content card every standalone page draws its body in (spec 050;
// contracts/content-card.md). One box in both themes: only colours change with the theme, so
// switching theme never moves the text. No props; the default slot is the page body.
---

<section
  id="content-section"
  class="prose lg:prose-lg dark:prose-invert prose-accent mx-auto mb-8 max-w-screen-lg rounded-2xl border border-dusk-200/80 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs sm:p-6 md:p-8 dark:border-dusk-700/80 dark:bg-dusk-800"
>
  <slot />
</section>
